<title>DENMARK: Danish August wholesale prices up 1.2 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Danish August wholesale prices up 1.2 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish wholesale prices were unchanged in August from July and up 1.2 percent from August 1995, the national statistics office said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>					Aug 1996  July 1996   Aug 1995</p>
<p>    Change on month (percent)    0.0	   +0.1	 -0.1</p>
<p>    Change on year (percent)    +1.2	   +1.1	 +2.8</p>
<p>    Index (base year 1990=100)  104.2	 104.2	103.0</p>
<p>NOTE - The statistics office changed the index base year to 1990 from 1980, effective April 1994. An analyst panel polled by Reuters forecast average WPI rises of 1.2 percent on an annual basis and 0.1 percent on a monthly basis. --Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33-969652</p>
</text>
